<title>POLAND: ANIMEX 96 GROUP NET DOWN TO PLN 11.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ANIMEX 96 GROUP NET DOWN TO PLN 11.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animex group results for the</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		25.17   vs   23.62</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		  19.85   vs   36.00</p>
<p>    Group net profit			11.20   vs   37.85</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Animex SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			951.44   vs  827.63</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		 826.40   vs  708.02</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss	     0.12   vs    0.15 profit</p>
<p>    Group income tax			 9.70   vs    5.35</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			0.00   vs    7.85</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	   129.08   vs   37.61</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		144.73   vs   27.71</p>
<p>    Group investment		     151.90   vs   24.34</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
